{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792108260, "covers_from": "2026-10-15T23:51:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-15T23:52:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792108320, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-15T23:51:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 25180, "sprite_key": "deer_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "文化", "content": "這幾年台北越來越沒特色，不像高雄有\n大港印象、台南古城印象，身為首都也有很多文化，台北人卻毫無光榮感", "display_name": "信義代表 No.25,180", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T23:51:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 5396, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "每座偉大的城市，都有一條的偉大河。我想要一條清澈的淡水河。", "display_name": "士林代表 No.5,396", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T23:51:24+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 39196, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "環境", "content": "想知道為什麼台北一直被砍樹，內湖港墘那邊的綠蔭都開始被砍了，那邊也不涉及捷運工程到底是為什麼？", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.39,196", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T23:51:39+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 25070, "sprite_key": "elephant_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "市政", "content": "我是都更顧問，都市更新處行政效率有夠差，連簽個會議記錄要搞個三周，說什麼都更大時代我看是都更大塞車", "display_name": "信義代表 No.25,070", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T23:51:54+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 61115, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "環境", "content": "凍蒜", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.61,115", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 5396, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.5,396", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 39196, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.39,196", "district": "neihu", "is_re